ity:.85;margin:8px 0 0\">Into your chosen currency.</p></div></div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Related.</h2><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px\"><a href=\"/payment-gateway-africa\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">Payment gateway for Africa</a><a href=\"/stablecoin-payment-gateway\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">Stablecoin payment gateway</a><a href=\"/merchant-dashboard\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">Merchant dashboard</a><a href=\"/pricing\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">Pricing</a></div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Questions.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:32px;max-width:880px\"><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"padding:22px 24px;font-weight:600;font-size:17px\">